<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><title>      He stopped second-guessing himself in bed    </title></head><body style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background: #ffffff; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%!important;">    <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#ffffff;">      For a while, he kept hoping things in bed would just improve on their own.    </div>    <table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr><td align="center" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 24px 12px;">          <table role="presentation" class="container" width="600" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: 600px; max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff;"><tr><td class="px" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-left: 22px!important; padding-right: 22px!important; padding: 10px 34px 0; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">                <div style="font-size:12px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:#7A838C;text-transform:uppercase;">                  A private frustration                </div>                <div class="hero" style="font-size: 33px; line-height: 39px; font-weight: bold; color: #1F252B; padding-top: 10px;">                  He stopped second-guessing himself in bed                </div>              </td>            </tr><tr><td class="px copy" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-left: 22px!important; padding-right: 22px!important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 27px; padding: 22px 34px 0; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #3F474E;">                <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">                  At first, he told himself it was nothing.                </p>                <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">                  Just stress. A long week. Bad timing. But after a while, he couldn&rsquo;t ignore the pattern. Things in bed didn&rsquo;t feel as easy, as strong, or as reliable as they used to.                </p>                <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">                  He wasn&rsquo;t looking for a big conversation about it. Like most men, he just wanted to feel confident again, stop overthinking, and trust his body in the moment.                </p>                <p style="margin:0;">                  Then he found a presentation built around male performance, stamina, and bedroom confidence. That was enough to make him stop scrolling and actually watch.                </p>              </td>            </tr><tr><td class="px" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-left: 22px!important; padding-right: 22px!important; padding: 18px 34px 0;">                <table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background: #F6F7F9;"><tr><td style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 18px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; color: #49525A;">                      It&rsquo;s hard to feel fully present in bed<br>                      when part of you is worried it won&rsquo;t happen the way it used to.                    </td>                  </tr></table></td>            </tr><tr><td class="px copy" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-left: 22px!important; padding-right: 22px!important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 27px; padding: 20px 34px 0; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #3F474E;">                <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">                  If performance, firmness, or confidence have been slipping lately, you are not the only one. A lot of men are looking for something that helps that side of life feel more natural again.                </p>                <p style="margin:0;">                  Sometimes the biggest shift starts when a man finally pays attention to what his body has been trying to tell him.                </p>              </td>            </tr><tr><td align="center" class="px" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-left: 22px!important; padding-right: 22px!important; padding: 26px 34px 0;">                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#5B6C7C" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background: #5B6C7C;">                      <a href="hxxps://storage[.]googleapis[.]com/victoryway/brightpath[.]html#4IgmWA233431TgQZ1120psiyautbti32KYOMXCXYXKCQKEN195982UEUB41122K11" target="_blank" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; padding: 16px 34px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; background: #5B6C7C;">WATCH THE VIDEO</a>                    </td>                  </tr></table></td>            </tr><tr><td class="px" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-left: 22px!important; padding-right: 22px!important; padding: 24px 34px 0; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: #5D666E;">                <p style="margin:0;">                  Confidence feels different when you no longer have to question what will happen next.                </p>              </td>            </tr><tr><td class="px" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-left: 22px!important; padding-right: 22px!important; padding: 30px 34px 28px;">                <center>                  <font size="2px">You may unsubscribe at any time. <a href="hxxps://storage[.]googleapis[.]com/victoryway/brightpath[.]html#5fkOxv233431fOPe1120pzjvdixizf32FFZAYCYWDBDZYUH195982ZNBW41122S11" style="-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-decoration: none;">Unsubscribe</a><br>                  C/O Biofraga 19655 E 35th Drive. Suite 100 Aurora, CO 80011</font>           <br>   <br>   <center>
